WEBVTT

00:01:57.738 --> 00:02:00.658
Except, as anyone can tell you,

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.162
who's looked at the evidence
from the Middle East,

00:02:04.203 --> 00:02:09.417
almost nothing of what I've just
been saying is actually true.

00:02:11.252 --> 00:02:14.297
And the consequences I'm going to suggest

00:02:14.297 --> 00:02:15.840
are quite profound.

00:02:16.924 --> 00:02:19.969
Actually, what happened
after the invention of agriculture

00:02:19.969 --> 00:02:22.430
around 10,000 years ago,

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:26.434
is a long period of around
another 4,000 years

00:02:26.475 --> 00:02:29.979
in which villages
largely remained villages.

00:02:29.979 --> 00:02:35.818
And actually there's very little evidence
for the emergence of rigid social classes,